<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday 💖</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9ecf, #ffcce6);
    overflow: hidden;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

/* Floating Hearts */
.heart {
    position: absolute;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: pink;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    animation: float 6s infinite;
}

.heart::before,
.heart::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: pink;
    border-radius: 50%;
}

.heart::before {
    top: -10px;
    left: 0;
}

.heart::after {
    left: -10px;
    top: 0;
}

@keyframes float {
    0% {
        bottom: -10%;
        opacity: 0;
    }
    50% {
        opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
        bottom: 110%;
        opacity: 0;
    }
}

/* Content */
.container {
    position: relative;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    padding: 20px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 3em;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px white;
    animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow {
    from { text-shadow: 0 0 10px white; }
    to { text-shadow: 0 0 25px #ff66b2; }
}

p {
    font-size: 1.2em;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

/* Button */
button {
    padding: 12px 25px;
    border: none;
    background: white;
    color: #ff4da6;
    font-size: 1em;
    border-radius: 25px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
    background: #ff4da6;
    color: white;
}

/* Hidden Message */
.hidden {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 1.3em;
    animation: fadeIn 2s;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {opacity: 0;}
    to {opacity: 1;}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Music -->
<audio autoplay loop>
    <source src="https://www.bensound.com/bensound-music/bensound-love.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
</audio>

<!-- Floating Hearts -->
<script>
for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {
    let heart = document.createElement("div");
    heart.className = "heart";
    heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
    heart.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 3) + "s";
    document.body.appendChild(heart);
}
</script>

<!-- Main Content -->
<div class="container">
    <h1>Happy Birthday 🎂💖</h1>

    <p>
        On this special day, I just want you to know that you’re someone truly special.
        Not just because it’s your birthday, but because of who you are every single day.
        The way you smile, the way you carry yourself, the little things you do—
        they don’t go unnoticed.
    </p>

    <p>
        Honestly… I admire you more than I probably should admit.
        You have this presence that just makes everything feel lighter,
        and even without trying, you leave an impact.
    </p>

    <p>
        I hope today brings you happiness, laughter, and everything your heart quietly wishes for.
        Because if anyone deserves it… it’s you.
    </p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">Click this 💌</button>

    <div id="secret" class="hidden">
        And… if I’m being real for a second—
        you’re one of the reasons my days feel a little brighter. 🌸
    </div>
</div>

<script>
function showMessage() {
    document.getElementById("secret").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
